Author: CusDeb OS Team
Description: Scale fixed pixel sizes in Remote Desktop Connection, Event Viewer and the picture viewer.
 mstsc: tab page position, banner and icons. Event Viewer: column widths,
 split positions and the icons of the detail buttons. shimgvw: the 96 DPI
 toolbar images are enlarged by a whole factor with pixel replication,
 and the default and minimum window sizes are scaled.
